{
  "format": 1,
  "about": "Conformance vectors for break-glass grants. Grant body signed: domain atlas-pca/break-glass/v1 NUL then strict-canonical JSON of {v,id,holder,grant_ref,reason_digest,max_uses,issued_at,expires_at,review_within,notify_to,authority}; review: atlas-pca/break-glass-review/v1 NUL over {v,id,outcome,notes_digest,at,reviewer}. Well formed: max_uses 1..16, expires_at > issued_at and at most 86400000 ms after it, review_within 1..2592000000, outcome justified|unjustified. Registry pins authorities and reviewers. use: checks in order bad_input, unknown_break_glass (also another holder), holder_frozen, revoked (unjustified review), not_yet_valid (now < issued_at), expired (now >= expires_at), budget_exhausted, not_notified; allow records the use (numbered from 1) and returns remaining and review_due = first use time + review_within. review: reviewer pinned, not the holder, not the authority (sod), first review final, requires a use, first_use <= at <= now. frozen(holder, now): some grant of the holder was judged unjustified, or has a use, no review and now >= first_use + review_within. accept refuses a frozen holder. Generated by scripts/gen-break-glass-vectors.ts.",
